# Sky critter body plan — the SMALL tameable creature (taming progression,
# WIKI: taming runs small -> whale). A compact flesh body driven by the SAME
# creature brain as the whale (combat/whale_ai.gd): it roams, is tameable at a
# LOWER Wisdom bar than a whale (LORE Beast Whisperer vs Master Trader), and is
# rideable — faster and nimbler than a whale, but it does NOT mine terrain.
#
# Preview it without booting the game:
#
#   godot --headless --path . --script tools/ship_preview.gd -- ships/critter.ship
#
#   W  blubber (buoyant flesh — the majority, so the critter floats)
#   M  meat (a small dense core)
#
# Blunt head to the RIGHT, tapering tail LEFT — the whale's silhouette in
# miniature. Keep it one connected piece and mostly blubber.

origin 2 1

